<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:20:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>JSE 寻求 Dangote 炼油厂二次上市以推动扩张</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/jse-courts-dangote-refinery-secondary-listing-in-expansion-push</link><description>非洲最大的证券交易所正在与丹格特集团合作，为其位于约翰内斯堡的巨型炼油厂的潜在二次上市铺平道路，该交易所负责人表示，这一结果将是其具有里程碑意义的尼日利亚首次公开募股后的理想下一步。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/jse-courts-dangote-refinery-secondary-listing-in-expansion-push'&gt;JSE 寻求 Dangote 炼油厂二次上市以推动扩张&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：JSE Courts Dangote Refinery Secondary Listing in Expansion Push&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/jse-courts-dangote-refinery-secondary-listing-in-expansion-push</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 10:21:56 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美联储利率走势和人工智能股票本周波动较大，金价稳定</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-steadies-as-fed-rate-path-and-ai-stocks-frame-volatile-week</link><description>交易员权衡美联储加息的前景与美国科技股反弹推动的更广泛市场复苏，金价企稳。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-steadies-as-fed-rate-path-and-ai-stocks-frame-volatile-week'&gt;美联储利率走势和人工智能股票本周波动较大，金价稳定&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Rises as Rebound in Tech Stocks Helps Revive Risk Appetite&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-steadies-as-fed-rate-path-and-ai-stocks-frame-volatile-week</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:53:35 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>风险偏好回归，铜价自 11 个月低点反弹</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/copper-rebounds-from-11-month-low-on-return-of-risk-appetite</link><description>铜价与亚洲科技股一起从 11 个月低点反弹，因人工智能交易担忧引发的数周波动后，市场风险偏好有所回升。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/copper-rebounds-from-11-month-low-on-return-of-risk-appetite'&gt;风险偏好回归，铜价自 11 个月低点反弹&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Copper Surges the Most in 10 Months as Risk Appetite Returns&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/copper-rebounds-from-11-month-low-on-return-of-risk-appetite</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:33:07 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Futures Rally as Tech Rebound Gains Momentum: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>经过数周的人工智能焦虑后，股市牛市再次骚动</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-27/stock-bulls-stir-again-after-weeks-of-ai-anxiety</link><description>交易员正在为短期反弹提供理由。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-27/stock-bulls-stir-again-after-weeks-of-ai-anxiety'&gt;经过数周的人工智能焦虑后，股市牛市再次骚动&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stock Bulls Stir Again After Weeks of AI Anxiety&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-27/stock-bulls-stir-again-after-weeks-of-ai-anxiety</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:16:37 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>